guide forever/miscellaneous/library-books
title Library Books
category Miscellaneous
keywords Library, books, Friend of the Library, Greater Friend of the Library, Garion Wendell, Owen Thadd, Comprehension Charm, Scholarly Pendant, Erudite's Amulet, Field Researcher's Loop, Philanthropist's Ring, Truthseeker's Bow, Crest of Elucidation, Researcher's Night Light
reward item 277203 277204
reward item 281634 281635
reward item 277254 277258 277260
why Lost books and scrolls all over the world: each pays experience at the library, and 10, 20 and 25 of them earn a necklace, a ring and an off-hand.
levels 15-60
zone Stormwind City

# The library book quests Forever kept from Season of Discovery. Each book is
# an item looted from an object (the Mural of Ta'zo: used); the book does not
# start its quest (the client's StartQuestID is 0 on every one): the librarian
# offers it while the book is in your bags. Every class can loot and hand them
# in, mages also get a Comprehension Charm. Garion Wendell (Stormwind Mage
# Quarter) takes them for the Alliance, Owen Thadd (Undercity Magic Quarter)
# for the Horde. The quests are taken and handed in one at a time, so the
# quest log never fills: there are more books than it holds.
#
# Order: four parts by the books' zone levels (10-25, 25-45, 40-55, 60), each
# Eastern Kingdoms then Kalimdor and ending at the library, so the first
# milestone reward (Friend of the Library, a level 23 necklace) comes after
# the low-level books instead of after Tanaris. Alliance-only: Antonidas and Rumi (the wiki names only
# Garion Wendell for them), Theocritus, Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings and both
# Greater Friend of the Library quests (their race masks in data/forever).
# Horde-only: Ta'zo (the wiki) and the Apothecary's Primer (race mask).
# Ta'zo, Demons and You and Legends of the Tidesages are items data/forever
# lacks, so they carry their names here (lint warns that it cannot fill them).
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, items, librarians: data/forever (QuestieDB Forever).
# - Book object ids and spawns: QuestieDB @ e9a67d1a2753a0e64c4c96bf7864788fac7b765f,
#   src/corrections/Forever/foreverObjectFixes.lua (hand-written Forever fixes,
#   one entry per book object); warcraft.wiki.gg book pages (CC BY-SA 3.0) for
#   405879, 421526 and 441248, which those fixes do not place, and as a check
#   on every other point. Not used: QuestieDB's generated SoD and Forever base
#   object files (built from Forever's quest data).
# - Where each book sits (the tips) and the milestone rewards: warcraft.wiki.gg
#   and Forever's quest data and players' reports from the local archive.
# - data/forever puts an Elwynn spawn (65.4,70.1) on 386691, the Antonidas
#   book; both sources above place 386691 in Ironforge only and that Elwynn
#   point on 386759 (Theocritus). The goals below are placed by hand.
# - Basilisks (79535), Demons and You (79950), Legends of the Tidesages
#   (81949) and Venomous Journeys (81954) end at one librarian each in
#   data/forever, while Forever's quest data lists both Owen Thadd and Garion
#   Wendell for all four. The steps keep both; needs an in-game check.
# - The milestone quests (Friend of the Library 78150, Greater Friend of the
#   Library 79536 and 82208) are offered by the librarian once enough books are
#   handed in. Forever's quest pages and players' caches give 82208 "Requires
#   level 35" where data/forever still has 30; the step waits for 35.
# Friend of the Library comes with the 10th different book: a player's
#   recording shows Garion Wendell offering it right after their 10th book
#   (2026-11-09), as three beta write-ups say.
# ASSUMED: the first Greater Friend comes with the 20th book, the second with
#   the 25th (books handed in earlier count towards each; three beta write-ups
#   agree on 20, one gives 25). Forever's data has no count. In-game check:
#   the librarian.
# INGAME: does Owen Thadd offer the two Greater Friend of the Library quests to
#   the Horde? Forever's quest pages list them for both sides (ending at Owen
#   Thadd too), and the knowledge base saw 82208 handed in to him;
#   data/forever's race masks are Alliance-only.
# INGAME: where does Ataeric: On Arcane Curiosities (item 210177, quest 79096,
#   Horde, Owen Thadd; on Forever's quest pages, not in data/forever) lie on
#   Forever? In Season of Discovery it was in the Sepulcher's main building in
#   Silverpine; beta write-ups have not found it there yet.
# ASSUMED: the level 60 books (Jennea Cannon and Oran Snakewrithe, the mage
#   trainers beside the librarians, take them: Forever's quest pages and
#   data/forever) lie where one beta write-up placed them on the live map;
#   Forever's data has no spawn for them. Undead Potatoes, The Knight and the
#   Lady and Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood? (84395, 84400, 84401) are
#   on Forever's quest pages but not in data/forever, so the guide collects
#   their books and names the hand-in in a tip. Magma or Lava? (84396) was a
#   mage quest in Season of Discovery; Forever opened it to every class (its
#   change notes: "Classes none instead of Mage"; forever-db/corrections).
#   In-game check: each spot.
# INGAME: does Oran Snakewrithe take the level 60 books from the Horde?
#   Forever's quest pages list them for both sides and end them at him too;
#   data/forever gives them Alliance race masks, so the Horde step is a `talk`.
# - The Mo'grosh ogres guarding Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings are elite
#   (npcs 1178-1181, 1183: rank 1, level 18-19).
# Not play-tested on Forever yet.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Part 1: books in level 10-25 zones

step Elwynn Forest
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Halfway up the Tower of Azora, east of Goldshire. Nothing hostile inside.
  collect 203755 @65.4,70.1                  -- Archmage Theocritus' Research Journal

step Westfall
  zone Westfall
  tip Two books: one in a house at Moonbrook, one at Sentinel Hill (Alliance only).
  collect 209845 @45.4,70.4                  -- Bewitchments and Glamours
  collect 208860 @52.7,53.8 only Alliance    -- Rumi of Gnomeregan

step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  tip The spellbook lies in the Dawning Wood Catacombs, the crypt in north-western Duskwood. Undead fill it; a corpse run works if you are low.
  collect 209849 @16.7,28.4                  -- Crimes Against Anatomy

step Ironforge
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  collect 203754 @76,10.4                    -- Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography

step Loch Modan
  only Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Scrolls in the Mo'grosh ogre cave in the north-east. The ogres in the cave are level 18-19 elites: grouping up is advised. (Rumi of Gnomeregan also lies in Thelsamar, if you missed it at Sentinel Hill.)
  collect 209850 @77.4,14 group              -- Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings

step Wetlands
  zone Wetlands
  tip At Whelgar's Excavation Site, the dig in the middle of the Wetlands.
  collect 209848 @33.6,47.9                  -- Goaz Scrolls

step Silverpine Forest
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip At Ambermill, the mage village in south-eastern Silverpine.
  collect 209844 @63.5,63.2                  -- The Dalaran Digest

step Tirisfal Glades
  only Horde
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip On a shelf in Brill's apothecary.
  collect 208185 @59.4,52.3                  -- The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer

step Darkshore
  zone Darkshore
  tip Down the stairs at the Ruins of Mathystra in northern Darkshore.
  collect 209843 @59.6,22.2                  -- Nar'thalas Almanac

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip On a barrel in a tent at Grimtotem Post, in the far south-east of the zone.
  collect 209851 @74.4,85.7                  -- Fury of the Land

step The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  tip Two books: the manual in the control room at the top of the oil rig at the Sludge Fen, and the Goblin Tome beside Gazlowe in Ratchet.
  collect 209847 @56.3,8.8                   -- Arcanic Systems Manual
  collect 208800 @62.7,36.3                  -- Baxtan: On Destructive Magics

step The Wailing Caverns' cave
  zone The Barrens
  tip The scrolls lie underground, in the cave below Lushwater Oasis by the Wailing Caverns entrance, not inside the dungeon. Go in at the cave mouth in the oasis and follow the cave down; the arrow points at the scrolls from the surface.
  goto 46,36.4 "Cave mouth at Lushwater Oasis"
  collect 209846 @49.3,32.9                  -- Secrets of the Dreamers

step Orgrimmar
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The Mural of Ta'zo is the stone tablet leaning against the wall in the Valley of Spirits, on the way to the mage trainers. Use it to take the book.
  collect 207972 "The Lessons of Ta'zo" @38.7,78.4

step The library: first books
  zone Stormwind City
  only Alliance
  tip Hand in the books so far. Garion Wendell keeps the library at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. He offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags: take it and hand it in, one at a time, so your quest log stays free. Skip the books you did not find.
