step Friend of the Library
  tip With 10 different books handed in, the librarian offers Friend of the Library: a choice of two necklaces (Scholarly Pendant or Erudite's Amulet). Take it when it appears.
  accept 78150 npc 211033 optional only Alliance
  turnin 78150 npc 211033 optional only Alliance
  accept 78150 npc 211022 optional only Horde
  turnin 78150 npc 211022 optional only Horde

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Part 2: books in level 25-45 zones

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Inside the first tower of the ogre fort at Gallows' Corner, in the middle of the zone.
  collect 215815 @48.4,57.6                  -- Defensive Magics 101

step Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Beside a tent entrance in the troll village in south-eastern Arathi.
  collect 215816 @73.6,65.2                  -- A Web of Lies: Debunking Myths and Legends

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip On a bench beside the Crystalvein Mine entrance, in the middle of the zone.
  collect 213165 @41.5,50.9                  -- Basilisks: Should Petrification be Feared?

step Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Inside a crypt near the middle of the zone, reached from the path to its south.
  collect 215820 @56.7,39.9                  -- Mummies: A Guide to the Unsavory Undead

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip On the top walkway of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, outside the dungeon.
  collect 220345 @70,51                      -- Sanguine Sorcery

step Desolace
  zone Desolace
  collect 215817 "Demons and You" @55,26.2

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Inside a hut on the Darkcloud Pinnacle mesa.
  collect 215683 @34.4,40.1                  -- Geomancy: The Stone-Cold Truth

step Dustwallow Marsh
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip On the ground at the eastern side of the murloc camp in north-eastern Dustwallow.
  collect 215822 @57.2,20.8                  -- RwlRwlRwlRwl!

