step Greater Friend of the Library
  only Alliance
  tip From level 20, with 20 different books handed in, Garion Wendell offers Greater Friend of the Library: Field Researcher's Loop or Philanthropist's Ring.
  level 20
  accept 79536 npc 211033 optional
  turnin 79536 npc 211033 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Part 3: books in level 40-55 zones

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip In the troll ruins of Shadra'Alor, in the south of the Hinterlands.
  collect 220350 @36,72.8                    -- Venomous Journeys

step Searing Gorge
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip On a table inside a tent near the middle of the zone.
  collect 220352 @37.8,49.3                  -- A Mind of Metal

step Blackrock Mountain
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Inside Blackrock Mountain, not in a dungeon: the book lies on the altar in Franclorn Forgewright's tomb, near Lothos Riftwaker. The waypoint marks the mountain.
  collect 220349 @28.96,28.93                -- Stonewrought Design

step Blasted Lands
  zone Blasted Lands
  collect 220353 @55.4,32.2                  -- Conjurer's Codex

step Azshara
  zone Azshara
  tip On a crate in the Haldarr Encampment, in the far west of Azshara.
  collect 220348 @20.7,62                    -- Everyday Etiquette

step Tanaris
  zone Tanaris
  tip On a bookshelf in the middle building of the pirate camp on the eastern coast.
  collect 220346 "Legends of the Tidesages" @72.6,47.8

