step The second Greater Friend of the Library
  only Alliance
  tip From level 35, with 25 different books handed in, Garion Wendell offers the second Greater Friend of the Library: Truthseeker's Bow, Crest of Elucidation or Researcher's Night Light (level 40 to equip).
  level 35
  accept 82208 npc 211033 optional
  turnin 82208 npc 211033 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Part 4: level 60 books

step Level 60 books: Western Plaguelands
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Eight more books lie in level 55-60 zones; the mage trainers beside the librarians take them, not the librarians. Necromancy 101 lies on a table in the ruined keep on Caer Darrow, above Scholomance (outside the dungeon); Undead Potatoes at Felstone Field.
  level 55
  collect 228141 @69.4,72.8                  -- Necromancy 101
  collect 228132 @38.2,54.6                  -- Undead Potatoes

step Level 60 books: Eastern Plaguelands
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip A Study of the Light is inside Light's Hope Chapel. The Knight and the Lady lies at Corin's Crossing; other copies lie elsewhere in the zone (one by the Stratholme gates), and you can take only one. Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood? is on a table in Plaguewood: wait for the patrolling elite to clear the creatures beside it and walk on.
  collect 228135 @71.8,48.2 live             -- A Study of the Light
  collect 228138 "The Knight and the Lady" @54.4,51.1 live
  collect 228140 "Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood?" @31.2,21 live

step Level 60 books: Timbermaw Hold
  zone Felwood
  tip Northern Kalimdor - A Comprehensive Guide lies inside the Timbermaw Hold tunnel between Felwood and Winterspring.
  collect 228134 @65.2,3.3                   -- Northern Kalimdor - A Comprehensive Guide

step Level 60 books: Everlook
  zone Winterspring
  tip Ka-Boom! sits on a shelf behind the alchemy supplier in Everlook.
  collect 228136 @60.7,37.7                  -- Ka-Boom!

step Level 60 books: Blackrock Mountain
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Magma or Lava? lies inside Blackrock Mountain, in the mine passage towards Blackrock Depths beyond the Molten Core quest giver. The waypoint marks the mountain.
  collect 228133 @28.96,28.93                -- Magma or Lava?

step The level 60 books: Jennea Cannon
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon, the mage trainer beside Garion Wendell in the Wizard's Sanctum, takes the level 60 books: she offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags. Hand in Undead Potatoes, The Knight and the Lady and Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood? the same way (their quests are not in Polestar's data yet).
  accept 84402 npc 5497
  turnin 84402 npc 5497
  accept 84398 npc 5497
  turnin 84398 npc 5497
  accept 84397 npc 5497
  turnin 84397 npc 5497
  accept 84399 npc 5497
  turnin 84399 npc 5497
  accept 84396 npc 5497
  turnin 84396 npc 5497

step The level 60 books: Oran Snakewrithe
  only Horde
  zone Undercity
  tip Oran Snakewrithe, beside Owen Thadd in the Magic Quarter, takes the level 60 books: each book's quest is offered while the book is in your bags. Take and hand them in one at a time (Polestar cannot track these quests for the Horde yet).
  talk 7825
